      "si": "SI-05",
      "title": "One dated, sourced dosing weight. UCUM units; no unit-less doses. **Dose arithmetic only in the Dose Engine** (static analysis fails the build otherwise). Hard stop at 10×/100× deviation. **The Dose Engine is P2.** Until it is active at a site, the **extended fallback control set** applies (§10.3): a system-enforced independent pharmacist double check on every weight- or BSA-based dose at any age, every high-alert infusion and every neonatal order; a drug-KB result ≥10× the maximum dose is a Tier A hard stop with the KB output shown verbatim; a pharmacist-cover alarm; review within 4 h of any dose given before verification. Core sites apply the double check at transcription. NICU and PICU go live with the rest of the site, never later",
      "title_source": "BUILD-PROMPT §2.1 SI-05, the Invariant column, verbatim",
      "enforced_in": "Dose Engine or fallback control set; CI static analysis",
      "hazards": [
        "HAZ-0005"
      ],
      "planned_test": "PropertyTest:SI-05-*",
