      "si": "SI-11",
      "title": "Transfusion requires a wristband ↔ unit ↔ order ↔ sample match plus a two-person electronic witness; a mismatch is a hard stop. Units from public blood banks are relabelled at receipt under two-person **blind double entry** of unit number, ABO/Rh, product and expiry from the original label and the issue note. The original label is never covered; the new label prints the unit number and ABO/Rh beside the barcode; the bedside witness also confirms the unit number on the original label; any mismatch quarantines the unit. Until T2 is activated: a scripted two-person check (identifiers scanned and shown side by side, both electronic signatures required, no automated pass/fail)",
